2 CONT Children/lapset Jockas/Juva Finland:
2 CONT *10.11.1723	18.11.1723	Wechmais	 	herr: Regen Quast: mest: Jacob Finne	fru Gertrud Helena von Dellvich	Maria
2 CONT *16.4.1726	19.4.1726	Wechmais by	hr Regem Qvarter mest: Jacob Leonhardt Finne	välb: fru Gertrud Helena v. Dehlvich	Otto Gustag
2 CONT *28.4.1728	3.5.1728	Wechmais herr: Regem: Qvartermäst: Jacob Leonhardt Finne	fru Gertrud Helena von Dehlvich	Anna Margareta
2 CONT *20.12.1729	26.12.1729 regements (quortermest:) Jacob Leonhard Finne	fru Gertrud Helena von Dehlvich	Sophia Margareta
