2 CONT Brief Life History of Maria Jacobsdotter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Maria Jacobsdotter Finne was born on 10 November 1723, in Vehmaa, Hartola, Mikkeli, Finland, her father, Jacob Leonhardt Finne, was 37 and her mother, Gertrud Helene Von Delwig, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Ernest Wilhelm Tihlman on 15 February 1752, in Mouhijärvi, Turku ja Pori, Finland. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Anna Helena Ernstsdotter Tihlman 1736–1832
2 CONT Maria Sophia Ernstsdotter Tillman 1756–
2 CONT Jacob Wilhelm Ernstsson Tillman 1761–
2 CONT Joachim Gustav Ernstsson Tihlman 1763–
2 CONT Ernst Fredric Ernstsson Tihlman 1765–1844
2 CONT Ebba Christina Ernstsdotter Tihlman 1768–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 4 October 1805, in Tampere, Häme, Finland, at the age of 81.
